// Shape of the SeaM query of aws_array_list_swap (verify-c-common), the
// motivating case of docs/design/SeaM-memops.md: three 128-byte memmoves
// expanded into 128-store chains, and a read of the list compared with the
// cells of the temporary. Input from the verify-c-common array_list_swap
// benchmark. --smt2: no solving.
//
// With --seam, memory-operation range terms keep the query below 10,000
// nodes and eliminate per-cell store chains.
//
// Size-zero pruning (docs/design/SeaM-provenance.md) removes null leaves
// from the copies' ranges and access addresses, so the
// translated read addresses s + (j - d) cancel their base through the ite
// of the list getter (diff.ite-same-base)
// and keep their object; the reads
// left undecided over a copy are in the copy's own object (symbolic
// offsets).
// RUN: sea-vc %S/Inputs/array_list_swap.mlir --lower --seam --smt2 --seam-stats 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=PROV
// PROV-DAG: seam.rule.addr.prune-size0-range: {{[1-9]}}
// PROV-DAG: seam.rule.diff.ite-same-base: {{[1-9]}}
// The shape is the query before the Ackermann lowering (--ackermannize=off;
// docs/design/Ackermann.md), which replaces the selects by constants.
// RUN: sea-vc %S/Inputs/array_list_swap.mlir --lower --smt2 --dag-stats 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=PLAIN
// RUN: sea-vc %S/Inputs/array_list_swap.mlir --lower --widen-memory=8 --seam --seam-row-expand=0 --ackermannize=off --smt2 --dag-stats 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=WIDE
// RUN: sea-vc %S/Inputs/array_list_swap.mlir --lower --seam --ackermannize=off --smt2 --dag-stats 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SEAM
// PLAIN: vc.dag-size: {{[1-9][0-9]*}}
// PLAIN: vc.dag-op: ite {{[1-9][0-9]*}}
// PLAIN: vc.dag-op: select {{[1-9][0-9]*}}
// WIDE: vc.dag-size: {{[1-9][0-9]?[0-9]?[0-9]?$}}
// WIDE: vc.dag-op: ite {{[1-9][0-9]*}}
// WIDE: vc.dag-op: select {{[1-9][0-9]*}}
// WIDE-NOT: vc.dag-op: store
// SEAM: vc.dag-size: {{[1-9][0-9]?[0-9]?[0-9]?$}}
// SEAM: vc.dag-op: ite {{[1-9][0-9]*}}
// SEAM: vc.dag-op: select {{[1-9][0-9]*}}
// SEAM-NOT: vc.dag-op: store

